Release fixes: the studio request sends again; /learn/ sends instructor@2; Clean up

Follows #361, which merged before these landed. Four commits on today's main.

- Clean up (hand edits): hosts.yml with full names (cards show first names), each tier's copy in
  `_config.yml` (`fcpm.tiers`), the nonprofit price on Producer only, "Current Student ID required" on
  Student, copy on /learn/, /reserve/ and /submit/, the studio request without its notes box.
- /reserve/: book.js read the notes box on every send, so with it gone the request died on a null and
  sent nothing, not even the email fallback. Notes now go only when the page asks for them.
- /learn/: the application sends `instructor@2` (FC-Public-Media/site-worker#7): method as one list of
  the four, `needs`, `audience`. A test holds the form to that tank's fields, so a renamed field fails
  in CI and not on an applicant.
- Tests follow hosts.yml's full names, Morey's skills, and Producer's nonprofit price.

